00:38:55,010 --> 00:38:55,650
Do you know what I mean?

545
00:38:56,210 --> 00:38:57,970
Instead of having them spawn somewhere else instead.

546
00:38:59,690 --> 00:39:00,870
See, I don't like this right here.

547
00:39:00,950 --> 00:39:02,990
It's way too deep and way too dark.

548
00:39:04,710 --> 00:39:09,450
But I will go down there and put torches.

549
00:39:10,290 --> 00:39:10,970
What are you going to do?

550
00:39:13,110 --> 00:39:13,430
Okay.

551
00:39:16,360 --> 00:39:17,040
And then here.

552
00:39:20,420 --> 00:39:21,240
Should I go down?

553
00:39:21,460 --> 00:39:22,080
I don't know.

554
00:39:24,220 --> 00:39:24,840
Ah, that's fine.

555
00:39:25,180 --> 00:39:25,880
I'm going back up.

556
00:39:28,860 --> 00:39:30,100
Oh, this is a bit too dark.

557
00:39:33,880 --> 00:39:36,700
See, I think I'm gonna need to have this on, just in case I fall.

558
00:39:37,840 --> 00:39:39,120
It is actually a lifesaver.

559
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:45,520
Hey there!

560
00:39:45,860 --> 00:39:47,700
So it's confirmed you can spawn there.

561
00:39:47,920 --> 00:39:48,680
That's good to know.

562
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:51,200
I have come to stop that from happening.

563
00:40:01,120 --> 00:40:02,060
Look at that.

564
00:40:03,640 --> 00:40:04,200
Beautiful.

565
00:40:05,800 --> 00:40:06,360
Alright.

566
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:09,480
This place looks safe.

567
00:40:11,160 --> 00:40:13,080
This right there could be a potential issue.

568
00:40:27,570 --> 00:40:28,010
What?

569
00:40:28,270 --> 00:40:29,350
It bounced off his head.

570
00:40:33,630 --> 00:40:34,070
Weird.

571
00:40:36,330 --> 00:40:37,630
Oh, this is that spot!

572
00:40:38,770 --> 00:40:39,630
That is funny.

573
00:40:41,410 --> 00:40:43,590
The best thing about this is I know where I am now.

574
00:40:43,690 --> 00:40:46,890
It's almost like an indicator of where my village is up above.

575
00:40:50,370 --> 00:40:51,670
Oh, hello there, mister.

576
00:40:53,630 --> 00:40:54,890
I can tangle with you.

577
00:40:56,630 --> 00:40:58,470
I do need more of your pearls.

578
00:41:00,910 --> 00:41:02,850
EDP engage, and boom.

579
00:41:03,810 --> 00:41:04,210
Come here.

580
00:41:11,430 --> 00:41:12,230
Come on, then.

581
00:41:16,800 --> 00:41:17,360
Oof.

582
00:41:19,640 --> 00:41:20,740
Didn't even drop one.

583
00:41:21,200 --> 00:41:21,940
Too bad.

584
00:41:28,280 --> 00:41:29,380
This is too dark.

585
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:38,620
Ah, sorry about that.

586
00:41:39,080 --> 00:41:39,960
That was a sneeze.

587
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:41,820
We gotta light this up.

588
00:41:43,880 --> 00:41:44,320
Here.

589
00:41:46,440 --> 00:41:48,560
And... I think this is also a bit too dark.

590
00:41:50,300 --> 00:41:54,860
Like, obviously this is... Then again, I'm not seeing any enemies.

591
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:59,180
So maybe I should take that as a sign that this place is okay.

592
00:42:10,010 --> 00:42:10,590
Still, though.

593
00:42:13,170 --> 00:42:15,450
Ah, I'm so sad I destroyed that spawner there.

594
00:42:17,910 --> 00:42:18,630
Ah, here we go.

595
00:42:20,230 --> 00:42:22,670
So you spawned down there, and you spawned over there.

596
00:42:24,590 --> 00:42:25,870
Thanks for pointing it out, guys.

597
00:42:35,720 --> 00:42:38,300
See, that is too dark, so he spawned over there.

598
00:42:40,820 --> 00:42:42,540
So the range is really small.

599
00:42:44,020 --> 00:42:45,040
On the torch, I mean.

600
00:42:48,860 --> 00:42:49,240
Okay.

601
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:56,200
You must have spawned behind me.

602
00:43:02,730 --> 00:43:04,490
See, I think this spot right here is too dark.

603
00:43:06,150 --> 00:43:07,250
Something could have spawned there.

604
00:43:14,190 --> 00:43:23,310
Here... Oh god, it's so big!

605
00:43:39,130 --> 00:43:43,450
There's no systematics in my doing here, it's just sort of on feel.

606
00:43:46,490 --> 00:43:47,470
Light that one up.

607
00:43:49,050 --> 00:43:52,350
I mean, at some point I'm just gonna go up there and try to build it and see if it works.

608
00:43:52,630 --> 00:43:55,590
If it doesn't work, I gotta come back down here and keep working.

609
00:43:58,930 --> 00:44:01,770
This whole thing is way too dark, I guess.

610
00:44:04,830 --> 00:44:08,410
And again, will they spawn in this perilous place?

611
00:44:11,290 --> 00:44:12,070
Maybe.

612
00:44:13,670 --> 00:44:14,690
Maybe not.

613
00:44:19,100 --> 00:44:19,800
Nobody knows.

614
00:44:20,980 --> 00:44:29,660
Actually, I wonder if there are certain blocks that some mobs cannot spawn on or some mobs will prefer to spawn on.

615
00:44:31,300 --> 00:44:39,520
Because I have noticed that, for example, when I'm in the forest, I feel like there are way more spiders there than some other places, right?

616
00:44:42,290 --> 00:44:47,530
Then again, it could also just be a result of me usually... when I see... it's like a confirmation bias.

617
00:44:48,050 --> 00:44:52,490
Because when I'm in the forest and I see enemies, it's usually in the night, right?

618
00:44:54,770 --> 00:44:57,510
And all kinds of manner of things spawn during the night.

619
00:44:59,970 --> 00:45:01,890
And there's a lot of surface area, I guess.

620
00:45:03,250 --> 00:45:05,810
So I've already been lighting that place, it seems.

621
00:45:07,630 --> 00:45:08,370
Very nice.

622
00:45:11,100 --> 00:45:11,880
It's a bit too dark.

623
00:45:12,880 --> 00:45:14,000
This is way too dark.

624
00:45:14,140 --> 00:45:14,700
Also up there.

625
00:45:22,960 --> 00:45:24,220
I would say that's too dark.

626
00:45:29,660 --> 00:45:30,640
What about here?

627
00:45:30,940 --> 00:45:31,280
Hello!

628
00:45:31,480 --> 00:45:32,180
Oh yeah, look at this.

629
00:45:32,580 --> 00:45:34,760
Love seeing these packs of monsters.

630
00:45:36,000 --> 00:45:38,860
Makes it even more satisfying to shut it down.

631
00:45:48,740 --> 00:45:49,720
Oh, you missed, huh?

632
00:45:50,480 --> 00:45:51,760
I was standing still as well.

633
00:45:51,920 --> 00:45:52,560
How did you miss that?

634
00:45:56,620 --> 00:45:58,000
Looks like I've already sort of been here.

635
00:46:01,300 --> 00:46:02,240
Ran out of torches?

636
00:46:02,400 --> 00:46:02,860
No way.

637
00:46:04,480 --> 00:46:05,480
But I can find wood.

638
00:46:11,960 --> 00:46:12,320
Oops.

639
00:46:17,260 --> 00:46:18,480
Why do we have wood?

640
00:46:20,100 --> 00:46:21,060
Is it down here?

641
00:46:23,440 --> 00:46:24,400
Did I bring some?

642
00:46:27,340 --> 00:46:28,800
No, I did not.

643
00:46:29,000 --> 00:46:29,260
Shit.

644
00:46:33,480 --> 00:46:35,260
I think... yeah, I see some.

645
00:46:35,420 --> 00:46:35,760
Perfect.

646
00:46:36,560 --> 00:46:38,960
We're gonna make some sticks and make more torches.

647
00:46:58,550 --> 00:46:58,990
Nice.

648
00:46:59,470 --> 00:47:01,010
Okay, I'm gonna take this wood here.

649
00:47:06,830 --> 00:47:08,090
Oh shit, I made it dark.

650
00:47:11,230 --> 00:47:11,670
Accidentally.

651
00:47:16,260 --> 00:47:17,740
Turn this into that.

652
00:47:18,180 --> 00:47:19,780
And turn these into sticks.

653
00:47:20,340 --> 00:47:22,440
And then we make torches.

654
00:47:23,540 --> 00:47:24,820
Ooh, we're back.

655
00:47:25,100 --> 00:47:25,420
Perfect.

656
00:47:26,460 --> 00:47:27,400
There we go.

657
00:47:27,660 --> 00:47:29,800
And let's fill this up with all the goodies.

658
00:47:32,140 --> 00:47:35,480
I guess I can put in my... yeah, stuff like that, I guess.

659
00:47:39,940 --> 00:47:40,720
Why not?

660
00:47:41,440 --> 00:47:41,700
Ah!

661
00:47:41,940 --> 00:47:45,180
Bones, let's keep these in the grass pouch.

662
00:47:45,600 --> 00:47:46,960
If we encounter a dog.

663
00:47:50,180 --> 00:47:51,320
Now we have it ready.

664
00:47:56,000 --> 00:47:56,600
Whoops.

665
00:47:58,780 --> 00:47:59,620
There we go.

666
00:48:00,920 --> 00:48:02,300
So where's home right now?

667
00:48:02,660 --> 00:48:07,700
Home is... that way.

668
00:48:11,820 --> 00:48:13,200
How far away am I though?

669
00:48:15,260 --> 00:48:16,540
So it's straight now.

670
00:48:18,860 --> 00:48:20,280
When does the needle move?

671
00:48:23,580 --> 00:48:24,100
Oh!

672
00:48:26,280 --> 00:48:27,100
Fucking hell.

673
00:48:28,840 --> 00:48:31,920
I'm inclined to go up there and experiment with the Trident again.

674
00:48:34,200 --> 00:48:35,720
But no, I'm too focused here.

675
00:48:36,000 --> 00:48:37,380
I'm locked in, baby.

676
00:48:40,390 --> 00:48:41,950
Ooh, that's atmospheric.

677
00:48:43,290 --> 00:48:44,090
Love that.

678
00:48:45,530 --> 00:48:46,490
Come on, pick it up.

679
00:48:47,050 --> 00:48:47,130
Huh!

680
00:48:47,670 --> 00:48:48,050
Spider!

681
00:48:48,430 --> 00:48:49,470
Where did you spawn?

682
00:48:52,670 --> 00:48:55,690
You need to die and you need to be eradicated with light.

683
00:49:03,010 --> 00:49:04,410
I reacted in time.

684
00:49:05,050 --> 00:49:06,470
Holy shit.

685
00:49:07,150 --> 00:49:08,570
That could have been a death.

686
00:49:09,710 --> 00:49:11,170
Oh, look at all these enemies.

687
00:49:11,910 --> 00:49:13,530
Holy crap, balls.

688
00:49:14,270 --> 00:49:14,910
On a string.

689
00:49:15,890 --> 00:49:17,110
Why are there so many enemies?

690
00:49:18,690 --> 00:49:20,230
What the actual shit?

691
00:49:29,390 --> 00:49:29,830
Huh?

692
00:49:29,830 --> 00:49:30,970
That went straight through him.

693
00:49:32,070 --> 00:49:33,110
Like it was nothing.

694
00:49:33,310 --> 00:49:33,870
Oh, he's gone.

695
00:49:35,590 --> 00:49:37,150
Time to stop the spawning here.

696
00:49:37,310 --> 00:49:38,490
Oh man, this is a big cave.

697
00:49:39,590 --> 00:49:42,110
Maybe I'm so far down that it doesn't matter here anymore.

698
00:49:44,630 --> 00:49:47,510
I should maybe not light this just yet.

699
00:49:49,950 --> 00:49:51,270
I think that's over the top.

700
00:49:53,950 --> 00:49:56,690
Yeah, I think I'll go further up again and light...

701
00:49:56,730 --> 00:49:59,030
That sort of level, so to speak.

702
00:49:59,990 --> 00:50:02,750
And when that's done, we go check the Orphan Crusher.

703
00:50:04,350 --> 00:50:07,310
If it doesn't work at all, or if it seems terrible, then we know what to do.

704
00:50:11,090 --> 00:50:12,530
Uh, not going this way.

705
00:50:17,130 --> 00:50:20,450
I mean, I'm still gonna light it as much as I can, of course, if I walk through it.

706
00:50:33,740 --> 00:50:34,860
Ooh, uh-oh.

707
00:50:42,940 --> 00:50:44,240
Got a spider spawner?

708
00:50:47,540 --> 00:50:48,920
God, man, it's so loud.

709
00:50:54,080 --> 00:50:54,880
Holy crap.

710
00:50:55,480 --> 00:50:56,600
There's a lot of this.

711
00:51:04,790 --> 00:51:08,030
Okay, it doesn't look like there's any spawners here.

712
00:51:11,770 --> 00:51:19,090
I mean, I need these anyway.

713
00:51:20,490 --> 00:51:21,750
I'll gladly take that.

714
00:51:30,210 --> 00:51:33,630
I think at least these platforms here, we should light those up.

715
00:51:34,610 --> 00:51:35,890
Because they're higher up.

716
00:51:38,730 --> 00:51:39,690
Almost fell down.

717
00:51:43,700 --> 00:51:46,980
It's actually a very big cave system that is underneath my house.

718
00:51:47,660 --> 00:51:51,760
Not to mention that we found a trial chamber right below our village.

719
00:51:52,260 --> 00:51:55,320
What, like 200 hours into the game?

720
00:51:56,280 --> 00:51:57,980
What the fuck is up with that?

721
00:51:59,220 --> 00:52:00,680
That is actually amazing.

722
00:52:01,360 --> 00:52:02,660
By the way, I need to go back there.

723
00:52:02,960 --> 00:52:04,980
I most likely haven't found all the rooms.

724
00:52:05,780 --> 00:52:07,920
And I still have keys left I want to use.

725
00:52:11,800 --> 00:52:12,180
There we go.

726
00:52:12,380 --> 00:52:13,100
Hello, spider.

727
00:52:15,620 --> 00:52:16,140
Goodnight.

728
00:52:16,680 --> 00:52:17,860
Ooh, minecart.

729
00:52:21,720 --> 00:52:22,240
NAMETAG!

730
00:52:22,540 --> 00:52:24,200
That reminds me we have a bunch at home.

731
00:52:25,520 --> 00:52:26,580
We gotta use them all.

732
00:52:26,980 --> 00:52:28,860
More torches and these things.

733
00:52:29,860 --> 00:52:30,260
Very good.

734
00:52:32,300 --> 00:52:34,040
Fill this one up with all the rails.

735
00:52:37,160 --> 00:52:40,200
I'll eat one piece of bread next time.

736
00:52:45,530 --> 00:52:46,490
I don't know what to put in here.

737
00:52:47,010 --> 00:52:47,510
I guess this stuff.

738
00:52:47,850 --> 00:52:48,910
Ah, bones go here.

739
00:52:51,030 --> 00:52:51,610
Redstone dust?

740
00:52:51,750 --> 00:52:51,990
Boo!

741
00:52:52,490 --> 00:52:53,430
I don't really need it.

742
00:52:55,230 --> 00:52:56,530
Things I don't need, I can put in here.

743
00:53:00,110 --> 00:53:00,470
Yeah.

744
00:53:04,930 --> 00:53:05,490
There we go.

745
00:53:06,050 --> 00:53:07,190
Look at that clean inventory.

746
00:53:07,830 --> 00:53:08,750
Feels good, doesn't it?

747
00:53:19,820 --> 00:53:20,660
Thank you.

748
00:53:24,440 --> 00:53:26,060
Now, I didn't even pay attention there.

749
00:53:26,580 --> 00:53:28,800
Does diamond give experience when you mine it?

750
00:53:30,420 --> 00:53:31,840
I never noticed.

751
00:53:32,580 --> 00:53:34,200
I'll try to notice next time.

752
00:53:41,080 --> 00:53:43,460
Oh god, this is a whole system again, isn't it?

753
00:53:44,220 --> 00:53:48,420
I don't really know if I want to... Actually, I do want to explore this because name tags.

754
00:53:50,200 --> 00:53:52,340
There's a bunch of name tags in these parts.

755
00:53:55,520 --> 00:53:57,900
And they are one of the rarest commodities in the game.

756
00:54:07,930 --> 00:54:09,050
Lit!

757
00:54:09,810 --> 00:54:10,590
Cheers!

758
00:54:17,960 --> 00:54:19,040
Look at all that ore.

759
00:54:21,620 --> 00:54:24,600
Gold does not give experience, of course, neither does iron.

760
00:54:24,720 --> 00:54:26,400
I don't think diamond does, to be honest.

761
00:54:27,740 --> 00:54:32,400
I think I want it to give me experience, and... you know, I'm coping.

762
00:54:35,120 --> 00:54:36,200
Ah, never mind, it does!

763
00:54:36,360 --> 00:54:37,520
It does give experience.

764
00:54:37,640 --> 00:54:38,740
Holy shit, I am wrong.

765
00:54:38,980 --> 00:54:40,260
I'm always wrong.

766
00:54:41,000 --> 00:54:41,420
Goddamn.

767
00:54:47,070 --> 00:54:50,810
See, all these enemies spawning here is a sign that it is too dark.

768
00:54:51,490 --> 00:54:52,850
There's a guy over there, I see you.

769
00:54:53,810 --> 00:54:55,630
Also, did this guy spawn up here, I wonder?

770
00:54:58,850 --> 00:54:59,250
Probably.

771
00:54:59,510 --> 00:55:00,130
Then he fell down.

772
00:55:16,970 --> 00:55:17,290
Spiders?

773
00:55:17,290 --> 00:55:18,170
Come out, come out.

774
00:55:24,830 --> 00:55:25,670
Okay, okay, okay.

775
00:55:25,730 --> 00:55:28,010
Come out when I want you to, not when I don't want you to.

776
00:55:31,990 --> 00:55:32,450
Uh-oh.

777
00:55:37,790 --> 00:55:40,710
See, something like this, I think I'm just gonna destroy that.

778
00:55:42,790 --> 00:55:43,110
Maybe.

779
00:55:46,290 --> 00:55:48,190
Actually, no, if I light it, it should be fine, right?

780
00:55:51,090 --> 00:55:52,150
Golden apple, nice!

781
00:55:52,970 --> 00:55:53,590
More bread?

782
00:55:53,730 --> 00:55:54,250
I'll take it.

783
00:56:00,350 --> 00:56:00,710
Fuck.

784
00:56:02,510 --> 00:56:03,730
I hear someone right above me.

785
00:56:03,910 --> 00:56:04,750
I know where you are.

786
00:56:05,370 --> 00:56:05,730
Hello!

787
00:56:17,740 --> 00:56:18,660
Oh, hello there.

788
00:56:20,260 --> 00:56:21,820
Don't even think about it.

789
00:56:28,020 --> 00:56:30,960
Man, I have so many rails, like in total now.

790
00:56:31,660 --> 00:56:35,600
I could probably build a railway across the entire world of Minecraft.

791
00:56:38,200 --> 00:56:40,180
Not really, but close.

792
00:56:43,420 --> 00:56:45,060
Get away from me!

793
00:56:50,340 --> 00:56:51,020
Hey!

794
00:56:53,020 --> 00:56:53,700
Goodnight.

795
00:56:54,580 --> 00:56:55,060
Ooh, diamonds!

796
00:57:10,680 --> 00:57:12,120
You have an enchanted axe!

797
00:57:12,560 --> 00:57:13,480
Good for you.

798
00:57:15,720 --> 00:57:17,000
Can they not come in here?

799
00:57:18,860 --> 00:57:20,060
What is your problem?

800
00:57:28,180 --> 00:57:30,260
I need that actually, thank you.

801
00:57:30,540 --> 00:57:31,140
And I need these.

802
00:57:37,960 --> 00:57:38,320
Hey!

803
00:57:40,300 --> 00:57:41,220
Where are you coming from?

804
00:57:41,320 --> 00:57:42,080
Are you coming from over here?

805
00:57:43,340 --> 00:57:44,060
You must be.

806
00:57:46,460 --> 00:57:48,000
Or... oh man, it's so big!

807
00:57:48,980 --> 00:57:50,060
It's time for me to exit!

808
00:57:54,220 --> 00:57:54,720
Compassing... okay.

809
00:57:57,830 --> 00:58:01,430
Let's go up there and start making the OC 3000 and see what happens.

810
00:58:03,970 --> 00:58:04,930
If it works, it works.

811
00:58:05,030 --> 00:58:05,810
If it doesn't, it doesn't.

812
00:58:05,970 --> 00:58:07,370
But we need to get a baseline here.

813
00:58:12,210 --> 00:58:13,310
I think I'll just go straight up.

814
00:58:24,640 --> 00:58:26,160
Time to engage the VLJ.

815
00:58:33,120 --> 00:58:34,900
This is gonna be a long one up, I think.

816
00:58:38,920 --> 00:58:39,300
