Did I fix that as well?

2728
02:59:52,820 --> 02:59:54,120
Looks fixed to me.

2729
02:59:56,740 --> 02:59:58,040
Looks fixed to me.

2730
03:00:00,000 --> 03:00:05,520
The nightmare I have right now is that some items get stuck in the pipe and never reach the hopper.

2731
03:00:07,720 --> 03:00:08,880
That would be a disaster.

2732
03:00:09,900 --> 03:00:11,860
And, by the way, something else I need to check.

2733
03:00:16,320 --> 03:00:17,400
First, let's do this.

2734
03:00:17,820 --> 03:00:19,560
This should give me something now.

2735
03:00:26,080 --> 03:00:26,740
Yeah?

2736
03:00:30,900 --> 03:00:41,800
And now... What?

2737
03:00:42,580 --> 03:00:45,440
I thought I could collect experience like I did just before.

2738
03:00:47,300 --> 03:00:48,400
Why can't I?

2739
03:00:51,410 --> 03:00:52,010
That's weird.

2740
03:00:54,050 --> 03:00:55,630
I picked up experience just before.

2741
03:01:00,770 --> 03:01:01,150
Hook!

2742
03:01:01,330 --> 03:01:01,570
Oh!

2743
03:01:01,870 --> 03:01:02,690
We can just sit here and wait.

2744
03:01:05,410 --> 03:01:07,870
Let's just... let's look at this in action.

2745
03:01:10,610 --> 03:01:12,250
By the way, time is flowing right now, right?

2746
03:01:12,350 --> 03:01:13,410
Like, it's not standing still.

2747
03:01:46,300 --> 03:01:47,720
Am I out of range?

2748
03:01:49,760 --> 03:01:53,020
I think I may be too far away for the spawning.

2749
03:02:00,700 --> 03:02:01,420
Wait a minute.

2750
03:02:03,000 --> 03:02:04,400
Let me go back up on the hill.

2751
03:02:08,180 --> 03:02:08,960
Oh, you.

2752
03:02:09,520 --> 03:02:12,160
Why did you... Oh, I thought you were inside.

2753
03:02:12,160 --> 03:02:13,320
Okay, you're not.

2754
03:02:13,600 --> 03:02:13,660
Good.

2755
03:02:16,980 --> 03:02:18,060
Yeah, back up the hill.

2756
03:02:26,360 --> 03:02:27,000
Let's listen.

2757
03:02:29,260 --> 03:02:30,060
I hear them!

2758
03:02:41,930 --> 03:02:42,590
Come on.

2759
03:02:43,050 --> 03:02:43,710
Fall down.

2760
03:02:55,030 --> 03:02:57,010
They're just wandering around right now, exploring.

2761
03:02:58,370 --> 03:02:59,370
They will fall down.

2762
03:03:00,990 --> 03:03:02,490
Let me actually take another look down here.

2763
03:03:02,910 --> 03:03:04,390
We did have an explosion, didn't we?

2764
03:03:09,090 --> 03:03:10,550
I actually completely forgot about that.

2765
03:03:11,450 --> 03:03:12,330
Okay, here we go, here we go.

2766
03:03:16,590 --> 03:03:18,430
I think I am out of range down in the village.

2767
03:03:23,350 --> 03:03:24,230
And there it goes!

2768
03:03:27,470 --> 03:03:28,410
Okay, I can't get up there.

2769
03:03:30,670 --> 03:03:32,790
Oh wait, I'm letting in light right now, I can't do that.

2770
03:03:35,630 --> 03:03:36,550
Keep it non-lit.

2771
03:03:41,320 --> 03:03:43,940
It's like... quantum mechanics, you know?

2772
03:03:44,000 --> 03:03:45,000
I can't observe it.

2773
03:03:45,160 --> 03:03:46,220
Then it acts differently.

2774
03:03:46,800 --> 03:03:48,860
But if I don't look, things are happening.

2775
03:04:13,820 --> 03:04:14,260
Okay.

2776
03:04:14,260 --> 03:04:15,460
Man, there's no way.

2777
03:04:17,440 --> 03:04:20,000
I wonder if I can somehow... Okay.

2778
03:04:21,920 --> 03:04:26,640
I wonder if there is a way to... So I'm out of range right now.

2779
03:04:26,800 --> 03:04:28,480
This is actually such a disaster.

2780
03:04:29,520 --> 03:04:31,840
I thought I would be close enough.

2781
03:04:37,670 --> 03:04:39,450
What I need to... Actually, yeah.

2782
03:04:39,890 --> 03:04:40,630
You know what I need?

2783
03:04:40,710 --> 03:04:46,370
I need to rig up some kind of device that will play a tone when something happens.

2784
03:04:47,410 --> 03:04:51,270
Because that way I can test the actual distance at which things are happening up there.

2785
03:04:54,950 --> 03:04:55,770
That's what I need.

2786
03:04:59,140 --> 03:05:03,980
So, let me actually... So if I... There should be nothing now, right?

2787
03:05:05,280 --> 03:05:06,360
Because I'm out of range.

2788
03:05:06,600 --> 03:05:08,340
And I think I'm even out of range down here.

2789
03:05:12,560 --> 03:05:13,060
Fuck!

2790
03:05:19,780 --> 03:05:21,400
Yeah, I'm out of range.

2791
03:05:28,790 --> 03:05:31,530
But if I fly up here, things start spawning.

2792
03:05:35,190 --> 03:05:36,310
Now things should spawn.

2793
03:05:38,190 --> 03:05:38,710
Listen.

2794
03:05:40,970 --> 03:05:42,410
Yep, now they're in there.

2795
03:05:44,970 --> 03:05:45,730
Fucking hell.

2796
03:05:54,900 --> 03:05:56,360
Oh, you know what it is probably?

2797
03:05:57,120 --> 03:05:58,460
I just realized something.

2798
03:05:59,780 --> 03:06:01,720
Maybe it's not because I'm out of range.

2799
03:06:03,860 --> 03:06:10,400
Maybe it's because when I go up here, I am also getting further away from the caves below.

2800
03:06:12,060 --> 03:06:17,160
Meaning the potential spawn points are being eliminated drastically, and this is the only option.

2801
03:06:17,580 --> 03:06:20,200
So when I'm actually down here, I'm not out of range.

2802
03:06:21,250 --> 03:06:24,650
I'm just in range of other potential spawn points.

2803
03:06:26,110 --> 03:06:27,590
Fuck, I gotta go back down.

2804
03:06:32,410 --> 03:06:37,630
Theoretically, if I were to make a platform in the air, let's say 50 blocks above here, right?

2805
03:06:38,110 --> 03:06:38,610
Up there.

2806
03:06:39,450 --> 03:06:40,410
And just sit.

2807
03:06:40,790 --> 03:06:42,390
This thing should work wonders.

2808
03:06:43,510 --> 03:06:48,250
Because if you imagine... Imagine a sphere in the sky, okay?

2809
03:06:48,470 --> 03:06:50,150
Centered on that beacon over there.

2810
03:06:50,310 --> 03:06:52,110
And the sphere's radius goes to here.

2811
03:06:52,330 --> 03:06:53,330
So it's like this.

2812
03:06:53,870 --> 03:06:54,290
Okay?

2813
03:06:55,210 --> 03:07:00,090
If that sphere is being moved up, so that the bottom part of the sphere is just touching the beacon...

2814
03:07:01,860 --> 03:07:03,040
The fuck was that?

2815
03:07:05,780 --> 03:07:06,360
No idea.

2816
03:07:06,800 --> 03:07:12,940
But if the bottom of the sphere is just touching the beacon, then it's looking for all these spawn points within the sphere, right?

2817
03:07:13,000 --> 03:07:15,060
And the only place it finds it is right there on the beacon.

2818
03:07:16,560 --> 03:07:18,520
And then it's going to put all the spawns there.

2819
03:07:19,120 --> 03:07:23,200
But if I'm, like, moving down, say I'm at my village there, right?

2820
03:07:23,220 --> 03:07:23,800
That's my village.

2821
03:07:24,160 --> 03:07:25,620
The sphere is now like this.

2822
03:07:26,480 --> 03:07:26,880
Okay?

2823
03:07:27,560 --> 03:07:28,440
So that...

2824
03:07:29,500 --> 03:07:35,420
The actual kill chamber takes up only a small fraction of the potential spots where things can spawn, right?

2825
03:07:36,440 --> 03:07:37,560
You understand what I mean.

2826
03:07:40,380 --> 03:07:42,680
In other words, I think I have to go back down.

2827
03:07:43,360 --> 03:07:44,380
Back to the caves.

2828
03:07:45,580 --> 03:07:46,100
Ah!

2829
03:07:46,740 --> 03:07:47,500
Let me out.

2830
03:07:51,720 --> 03:07:53,940
This is all looking good, I guess.

2831
03:07:55,060 --> 03:07:56,340
Maybe we replace that.

2832
03:08:02,400 --> 03:08:03,580
Let's put some stuff in here.

2833
03:08:08,700 --> 03:08:11,000
But I have great faith this will be good.

2834
03:08:13,600 --> 03:08:15,500
I have only three trapdoors left.

2835
03:08:16,120 --> 03:08:16,640
Wow.

2836
03:08:22,900 --> 03:08:23,740
Stack these.

2837
03:08:24,620 --> 03:08:26,380
Ah, the bone stay, the bone stay.

2838
03:08:31,060 --> 03:08:33,640
Sea pickle, I would say that's green.

2839
03:08:43,220 --> 03:08:44,340
Gunpowder is here.

2840
03:08:45,500 --> 03:08:46,580
Rotten flesh.

2841
03:08:48,640 --> 03:08:50,140
I'll put that here, I guess.

2842
03:08:51,280 --> 03:08:52,360
Shield goes on.

2843
03:08:55,540 --> 03:08:56,780
That's a bit too many.

2844
03:08:57,300 --> 03:08:58,220
Let's take only half.

2845
03:09:08,460 --> 03:09:09,720
There we go.

2846
03:09:10,300 --> 03:09:11,240
Torches, I need more.

2847
03:09:18,900 --> 03:09:20,220
Ah, maybe I don't bring that.

2848
03:09:20,980 --> 03:09:22,300
Yeah, just leave it here for safety.

2849
03:09:22,820 --> 03:09:24,960
I had a brush with death just before.

2850
03:09:26,000 --> 03:09:27,240
A bit too risky, I think.

2851
03:09:28,280 --> 03:09:30,200
Now, I do want to bring a bit of wood with me.

2852
03:09:32,940 --> 03:09:34,280
Yeah, that's good.

2853
03:09:37,800 --> 03:09:40,600
More food would be fantastic as well.

2854
03:09:49,530 --> 03:09:50,510
I'll just bring a bunch.

2855
03:09:54,870 --> 03:09:55,930
I don't know what I should eat.

2856
03:09:56,050 --> 03:09:58,710
Maybe, maybe, maybe some chicken.

2857
03:09:59,690 --> 03:10:00,290
Chicken's good.

2858
03:10:01,230 --> 03:10:03,590
Now, one last check before we go.

2859
03:10:18,720 --> 03:10:19,940
Let's eliminate possibilities.

2860
03:10:20,180 --> 03:10:24,720
So I think I'm right with the sphere of influence and the reason why it doesn't work down here.

2861
03:10:25,440 --> 03:10:28,240
It's either that or I'm just not in range.

2862
03:10:29,040 --> 03:10:30,360
Which is super possible.

2863
03:10:32,320 --> 03:10:33,760
What if I'm just not in range?

2864
03:10:33,980 --> 03:10:35,380
How far away am I right now?

2865
03:10:47,660 --> 03:10:51,920
I'm trying to think, have I ever seen anything at that distance that I would like to shoot?

2866
03:10:53,340 --> 03:10:54,760
It's quite far away.

2867
03:11:02,490 --> 03:11:03,910
Let me get a little closer.

2868
03:11:06,450 --> 03:11:11,190
Like, statistically speaking, there should still be some mobs up there.

2869
03:11:12,090 --> 03:11:15,530
Even though, you know, chances are not high.

2870
03:11:17,950 --> 03:11:19,370
When can I start hearing them?

2871
03:11:21,890 --> 03:11:23,290
Man, I need tinted glass.

2872
03:11:26,190 --> 03:11:27,910
I actually need tinted glass.

2873
03:11:29,190 --> 03:11:30,310
See, now they're there.

2874
03:11:40,900 --> 03:11:41,760
Let's actually look.

2875
03:11:42,060 --> 03:11:43,240
So it's currently night.

2876
03:11:44,780 --> 03:11:46,900
What is the furthest I can see an enemy?

2877
03:11:47,560 --> 03:11:48,780
If I stand on this side.

2878
03:11:50,540 --> 03:11:51,800
In the forest, down there.

2879
03:11:51,960 --> 03:11:52,520
Okay, wow.

2880
03:11:52,720 --> 03:11:54,100
Okay, that's quite far away, though.

2881
03:11:56,180 --> 03:11:56,860
Look at that.

2882
03:11:57,100 --> 03:11:58,680
That is pretty far away.

2883
03:11:58,820 --> 03:11:59,500
Same as that guy?

2884
03:12:06,240 --> 03:12:08,180
I don't think it's the distance problem, then.

2885
03:12:11,020 --> 03:12:14,040
Because he was about the same distance as there.

2886
03:12:14,260 --> 03:12:15,540
It's actually almost the same.

2887
03:12:20,680 --> 03:12:22,280
And listen, now we don't hear anything.

2888
03:12:22,440 --> 03:12:23,200
You know why?

2889
03:12:23,840 --> 03:12:24,800
Because it's night.

2890
03:12:26,780 --> 03:12:29,780
And there's mob spawning outside here as well.

2891
03:12:29,960 --> 03:12:32,120
All of this has now become potential spawn location.

2892
03:12:33,640 --> 03:12:37,540
That's... That's why we don't hear anything in there right now.

2893
03:12:38,480 --> 03:12:39,140
That's why.

2894
03:12:40,780 --> 03:12:45,280
I'm really trying to get out of... going back down to the caves.

2895
03:12:46,220 --> 03:12:47,060
I'm stalling.

2896
03:12:47,160 --> 03:12:47,600
A lot.

2897
03:12:48,400 --> 03:12:48,940
Fuck it.

2898
03:12:49,880 --> 03:12:51,400
I see a potential issue here, actually.

2899
03:12:53,660 --> 03:12:54,280
What's this?

2900
03:12:57,540 --> 03:12:58,460
Hold on a minute.

2901
03:13:06,060 --> 03:13:06,940
Wait, where is this?

2902
03:13:11,560 --> 03:13:12,380
Oh, okay.

2903
03:13:14,180 --> 03:13:15,560
No, wait, I don't recognize it.

2904
03:13:16,600 --> 03:13:18,020
Oh, shit, there's darkness here.

2905
03:13:18,720 --> 03:13:19,840
Ooh, we have issues.

2906
03:13:22,540 --> 03:13:23,320
Issues spotted.

2907
03:13:23,820 --> 03:13:24,020
Fuck.

2908
03:13:25,660 --> 03:13:26,400
Give me that!

2909
03:13:27,100 --> 03:13:27,980
I hate the flow.

2910
03:13:30,420 --> 03:13:31,160
Stop the flow.

2911
03:13:51,110 --> 03:13:52,250
I hear skeletons.

2912
03:13:59,450 --> 03:14:00,790
You know what I should do?

2913
03:14:01,250 --> 03:14:10,330
I should go to the kill chamber, dig straight down, and listen to when I start hearing monsters.

2914
03:14:13,230 --> 03:14:15,150
Because there could be small caves lurking.

2915
03:14:21,160 --> 03:14:22,220
I hear you.

2916
03:14:30,720 --> 03:14:31,320
Aha!

2917
03:14:33,000 --> 03:14:34,160
Look at that.

2918
03:14:37,820 --> 03:14:40,600
Hiding... Oh, this is a potential problem.

2919
03:14:40,780 --> 03:14:41,340
Look at this.

2920
03:14:42,580 --> 03:14:43,820
Big issues here.

2921
03:14:45,400 --> 03:14:48,080
Yeah, this one could be ruining the entire experiment.

2922
03:14:55,680 --> 03:14:56,600
That's quite deep.

2923
03:14:56,900 --> 03:14:58,700
Let's clear the top before we go down.

2924
03:15:06,900 --> 03:15:15,820
I'm assuming they can't... Well, if there's water... Maybe the water zombies can spawn.

2925
03:15:17,740 --> 03:15:19,400
But, I mean, whatever.

2926
03:15:21,440 --> 03:15:22,480
It's probably fine.

2927
03:15:37,000 --> 03:15:37,840
There we go.

2928
03:15:39,100 --> 03:15:41,200
This should really eliminate a lot, I think.

2929
03:15:41,940 --> 03:15:42,900
That was a big one.

2930
03:15:44,080 --> 03:15:45,320
What about this whole area?

2931
03:15:46,440 --> 03:15:47,680
I mean, it's all flooded.

2932
03:15:49,920 --> 03:15:51,280
Maybe... that's fine.

2933
03:15:56,980 --> 03:15:58,080
Here we go, issues.

2934
03:15:58,840 --> 03:15:59,820
Lots of issues.

2935
03:16:08,480 --> 03:16:08,820
Fixed.

2936
03:16:08,820 --> 03:16:17,400
I wish I had some kind of... some kind of 3D scanner similar to the one you have in Subnautica where you can see the caves.

2937
03:16:17,560 --> 03:16:17,920
Do you know what I mean?

2938
03:16:18,800 --> 03:16:22,020
So I can see what kind of caves are around me.

2939
03:16:23,920 --> 03:16:25,080
That's really what I need.

2940
03:16:29,720 --> 03:16:30,640
Okay, now we go down here.

2941
03:16:35,600 --> 03:16:36,520
I've been here before.

2942
03:16:37,940 --> 03:16:41,480
Oh, that looks like something I've done to get out of there.

2943
03:16:41,580 --> 03:16:42,640
Wait, did I do that just now?

2944
03:16:44,320 --> 03:16:45,300
Maybe I did that just now.

2945
03:16:47,480 --> 03:16:48,220
I probably did.

2946
03:16:51,920 --> 03:16:53,020
We're not going to talk about that.

2947
03:16:56,740 --> 03:16:57,720
This one is secure.

2948
03:17:06,300 --> 03:17:07,760
Look at you spawning there!

2949
03:17:08,020 --> 03:17:08,880
I hate that.

2950
03:17:09,580 --> 03:17:10,480
You gotta go.

2951
03:17:19,320 --> 03:17:20,020
Where are you?

2952
03:17:20,100 --> 03:17:20,520
There you are.

2953
03:17:29,480 --> 03:17:29,840
Ooh!

2954
03:17:32,280 --> 03:17:33,360
Look at this!

2955
03:17:35,340 --> 03:17:36,620
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

2956
03:17:36,660 --> 03:17:37,320
We can't have that.

2957
03:17:40,860 --> 03:17:41,220
Hello?

2958
03:17:44,340 --> 03:17:45,360
Let me shoot your feet.

2959
03:17:47,020 --> 03:17:47,760
Right in the foot.

2960
03:17:50,620 --> 03:17:51,980
So now we're back in this cave.

2961
03:17:54,620 --> 03:17:55,720
Not surprising, I guess.

2962
03:17:56,180 --> 03:18:00,140
It's a huge cave and it links to all kinds of mini sub caves and tunnels.

2963
03:18:22,250 --> 03:18:24,030
This one is... Ah, here we go.

2964
03:18:24,130 --> 03:18:24,450
Darkness.

2965
03:18:24,810 --> 03:18:25,130
Spot it.

2966
03:18:32,330 --> 03:18:33,270
I have been here.

2967
03:18:33,790 --> 03:18:35,050
I have done this.

2968
03:18:35,310 --> 03:18:35,910
I think.

2969
03:18:36,290 --> 03:18:37,550
Doesn't this look like something I'd do?

2970
03:18:40,650 --> 03:18:42,110
That over there looks problematic.

2971
03:18:42,710 --> 03:18:43,770
Shit, I don't have my flyer.

2972
03:18:46,820 --> 03:18:47,220
Stupid.

2973
03:18:48,580 --> 03:18:49,560
I should have brought it.

2974
03:18:49,640 --> 03:18:50,920
I don't know what came over me.

2975
03:18:55,520 --> 03:19:05,580
I can reach that.

2976
03:19:19,660 --> 03:19:20,560
Keep lighting.

2977
03:19:26,760 --> 03:19:28,060
That looks problematic.

2978
03:19:38,320 --> 03:19:40,120
Yeah, look at all this right here.

2979
03:19:41,240 --> 03:19:50,280
Oh man, this... I may be starting to regret my decision to make the Orphan Crusher where it is.

2980
03:19:55,040 --> 03:19:56,520
No, I'm not.

2981
03:19:56,820 --> 03:19:58,140
It's a great fucking place.

2982
03:19:58,300 --> 03:19:58,700
It's genius.

2983
03:19:59,120 --> 03:20:00,440
We just gotta fix all this.

2984
03:20:04,340 --> 03:20:06,400
As soon as I get this fixed, it's gonna work.

2985
03:20:07,460 --> 03:20:07,920
Trust.

2986
03:20:11,900 --> 03:20:13,660
It just takes a bit of effort here.

2987
03:20:24,840 --> 03:20:25,620
Look at that.

2988
03:20:27,380 --> 03:20:28,300
Fully lighted.

2989
03:20:30,860 --> 03:20:32,480
This is a huge problem area here.

2990
03:20:39,320 --> 03:20:39,760
Yep.

