03:39:28,770 --> 03:39:30,130
This went a lot faster than I thought.

3259
03:39:35,040 --> 03:39:35,940
Spiders over there.

3260
03:39:36,500 --> 03:39:39,780
All the spawning happening, I'm seeing it in action.

3261
03:39:50,050 --> 03:39:55,610
I gotta say, though, I have been a little obsessed with the whole figuring out the spawning stuff recently.

3262
03:39:56,590 --> 03:39:58,690
And I kinda wanna start doing other things as well.

3263
