Like, maybe take a small break from all the spawning experiments and the Orphan Crusher.

3264
03:40:06,250 --> 03:40:08,150
And do some of the other stuff on the list.

3265
03:40:08,810 --> 03:40:11,390
And then come back to this, of course, because I do wanna do it.

3266
03:40:17,660 --> 03:40:18,820
Okay, light that up.

3267
03:40:19,660 --> 03:40:20,240
Hey man!

3268
03:40:20,740 --> 03:40:21,640
You wanna tango?

3269
03:40:23,640 --> 03:40:24,220
Oh wait!

3270
03:40:25,820 --> 03:40:26,860
I'm in a bad spot, bad spot!

3271
03:40:30,520 --> 03:40:31,140
That works.

3272
03:40:38,700 --> 03:40:39,380
There we go.

3273
03:40:43,630 --> 03:40:44,590
Didn't get a pearl.

3274
03:40:47,190 --> 03:40:47,770
Too bad.

3275
03:40:47,910 --> 03:40:50,750
Let's do the outline of the cave here first, and then we sort of fill it up.

3276
03:40:52,570 --> 03:40:52,950
Afterwards.

3277
03:40:55,010 --> 03:40:56,070
Cannot believe I missed that.

3278
03:40:59,330 --> 03:41:00,610
Zombies bo- What the hell?

3279
03:41:01,810 --> 03:41:02,610
What are you doing here?

3280
03:41:05,470 --> 03:41:06,770
They're so rare, actually.

3281
03:41:19,750 --> 03:41:20,710
Running low on food.

3282
03:41:21,290 --> 03:41:22,990
Oh no, not another mine!

3283
03:41:23,170 --> 03:41:23,290
Look!

3284
03:41:26,970 --> 03:41:27,410
Fuck!

3285
03:41:28,610 --> 03:41:29,990
That's a mess to light up.

3286
03:41:33,450 --> 03:41:37,510
But then again, I think I may be going so far away right now from my home that maybe it doesn't matter.

3287
03:41:38,390 --> 03:41:40,210
I'm just doing surface level lighting here.

3288
03:41:49,910 --> 03:41:52,050
I'm barely paying attention to the actual cave.

3289
03:41:59,070 --> 03:41:59,590
Okay.

3290
03:42:01,310 --> 03:42:01,830
Oops.

3291
03:42:04,070 --> 03:42:05,530
Let's just stop the light here.

3292
03:42:08,470 --> 03:42:10,430
And assume it's out of range right now.

3293
03:42:10,570 --> 03:42:12,890
Let's just continue lighting the primary cave over here.

3294
03:42:20,380 --> 03:42:22,200
I hear bastards in here.

3295
03:42:22,940 --> 03:42:23,940
Oh!

3296
03:42:24,900 --> 03:42:26,840
Oh, zombie again!

3297
03:42:28,520 --> 03:42:30,140
Fuck me.

3298
03:42:33,560 --> 03:42:34,560
Oh.

3299
03:42:36,600 --> 03:42:37,780
There we go.

3300
03:42:41,200 --> 03:42:42,780
Are you kidding me?

3301
03:42:44,340 --> 03:42:45,640
Ah, well.

3302
03:42:46,820 --> 03:42:47,520
Dang.

3303
03:42:51,030 --> 03:42:52,990
What is my RNG here?

3304
03:42:55,650 --> 03:42:56,690
Super unlucky.

3305
03:43:03,270 --> 03:43:04,430
Light that up.

3306
03:43:13,150 --> 03:43:13,770
Hey.

3307
03:43:15,890 --> 03:43:17,110
I do need to kill you.

3308
03:43:23,760 --> 03:43:24,700
Mistakes were maybe made.

3309
03:43:48,610 --> 03:43:49,770
Oh my god.

3310
03:43:51,550 --> 03:43:53,290
Why did I break the golden rule?

3311
03:43:54,070 --> 03:43:55,850
Never fight them without an EDP.

3312
03:43:56,170 --> 03:43:56,710
Fuck me.

3313
03:43:56,990 --> 03:43:57,810
What am I doing?

3314
03:43:59,130 --> 03:44:00,090
You idiot.

3315
03:44:01,290 --> 03:44:02,370
You'll never win.

3316
03:44:04,870 --> 03:44:07,130
I got way too confident.

3317
03:44:07,410 --> 03:44:07,710
Again.

3318
03:44:10,810 --> 03:44:12,350
It's a miracle I'm still alive.

3319
03:44:16,620 --> 03:44:17,060
Whoo!

3320
03:44:18,020 --> 03:44:19,220
Eat that tater, boy!

3321
03:44:22,860 --> 03:44:23,780
Oh, you want some?

3322
03:44:26,500 --> 03:44:27,200
Oh, god.

3323
03:44:28,080 --> 03:44:28,800
What a miss.

3324
03:44:29,000 --> 03:44:29,540
What a miss.

3325
03:44:34,300 --> 03:44:34,840
Got him.

3326
03:44:53,980 --> 03:44:55,240
Light that up.

3327
03:44:55,440 --> 03:44:55,760
Hello!

3328
03:45:06,980 --> 03:45:07,980
Got him.

3329
03:45:12,900 --> 03:45:13,780
Hey.

3330
03:45:20,600 --> 03:45:21,820
It was burning.

3331
03:45:24,280 --> 03:45:25,380
Crisp bat.

3332
03:45:27,220 --> 03:45:28,140
Sounds good.

3333
03:45:28,780 --> 03:45:29,300
I'd eat that.

3334
03:45:35,340 --> 03:45:36,880
Yo, look at that!

3335
03:45:38,100 --> 03:45:39,560
We got a green area.

3336
03:45:44,180 --> 03:45:46,100
Green area with green enemies.

3337
03:45:46,560 --> 03:45:47,480
Isn't that fitting?

3338
03:46:05,800 --> 03:46:10,680
Now, I don't think I need to go up there and light that, because if you look at it, it's pretty lit.

3339
03:46:11,900 --> 03:46:12,640
As it is.

3340
03:46:15,560 --> 03:46:16,760
But I do want to explore it.

3341
03:46:17,480 --> 03:46:18,300
Just not right now.

3342
03:46:26,220 --> 03:46:28,340
How did I just catch myself on fire?

3343
03:46:41,660 --> 03:46:42,880
I see diamonds.

3344
03:46:48,860 --> 03:46:52,560
My fire aspect is actually working against me half the time.

3345
03:46:53,260 --> 03:46:56,240
Because it sets enemies alight, and then they hit me and I burn.

3346
03:46:58,040 --> 03:46:58,900
Very annoying.

3347
03:46:59,920 --> 03:47:00,460
What?

3348
03:47:05,260 --> 03:47:06,500
He's working for me.

3349
03:47:26,790 --> 03:47:30,990
It's weirdly compelling though, just lighting these caves.

3350
03:47:35,930 --> 03:47:37,170
Let's take a look at what we've done.

3351
03:47:40,400 --> 03:47:41,280
Check this out.

3352
03:47:43,320 --> 03:47:43,760
Huh?

3353
03:47:44,040 --> 03:47:44,980
Pretty well lit!

3354
03:47:45,600 --> 03:47:46,980
There's a spot over there I missed.

3355
03:47:48,480 --> 03:47:57,680
Obviously, there's all these sub caves in here with the mines and all that, but... Yeah, for now, let's just not do that.

3356
03:47:58,320 --> 03:47:59,600
It's probably gonna be fine.

3357
03:48:02,560 --> 03:48:03,260
Maybe a bit.

3358
03:48:04,140 --> 03:48:05,280
Can't hurt a bit, can it?

3359
03:48:05,480 --> 03:48:06,820
Just a little bit.

3360
03:48:08,860 --> 03:48:09,380
Oh, no.

3361
03:48:11,220 --> 03:48:11,940
Okay, that's it.

3362
03:48:12,780 --> 03:48:13,280
That's it.

3363
03:48:13,380 --> 03:48:14,880
Just a little bit, like I said, and I'm out.

3364
03:48:18,520 --> 03:48:20,480
I'm the master of not getting distracted today.

3365
03:48:20,560 --> 03:48:21,220
I'm locked in.

3366
03:48:22,240 --> 03:48:23,200
My food is gone.

3367
03:48:23,340 --> 03:48:24,520
I have nine bread left.

3368
03:48:41,550 --> 03:48:41,910
Good.

3369
03:48:49,030 --> 03:48:49,910
That's way too dark.

3370
03:48:54,290 --> 03:48:55,790
Oh yeah, look at all these enemies!

3371
03:48:57,550 --> 03:49:00,290
I've soon joined up with the other side of the cave that I have lit up.

3372
03:49:06,790 --> 03:49:07,610
Child is dead.

3373
03:49:07,970 --> 03:49:08,690
Love to see it.

3374
03:49:11,680 --> 03:49:13,140
This guy is resistant.

3375
03:49:13,500 --> 03:49:14,120
There we go.

3376
03:49:16,560 --> 03:49:17,440
Oh, hello there!

3377
03:49:18,580 --> 03:49:19,420
How y'all doing?

3378
03:49:21,000 --> 03:49:21,960
What do you got for me?

3379
03:49:22,640 --> 03:49:23,260
Is that sugar?

3380
03:49:24,660 --> 03:49:25,380
I'll take it.

3381
03:49:34,440 --> 03:49:37,260
I mean, I'm getting my experience back here at level 20 soon.

3382
03:49:39,040 --> 03:49:40,120
Just for murdering.

3383
03:49:51,550 --> 03:49:52,550
Why can I not sprint?

3384
03:49:53,590 --> 03:49:55,030
Oh, I have slowness on!

3385
03:49:56,310 --> 03:49:57,330
That explains it.

3386
03:50:00,230 --> 03:50:03,110
For a brief second there, my mind was like, I'm over-encompered.

3387
03:50:03,250 --> 03:50:04,510
But that's not a thing in Minecraft.

3388
03:50:08,210 --> 03:50:09,310
Look at all you fools.

3389
03:50:12,450 --> 03:50:13,870
I'm gonna have to kill you all.

3390
03:50:17,660 --> 03:50:18,800
And you cannot keep spawning.

3391
03:50:19,300 --> 03:50:20,380
I'm sorry, but it's not allowed.

3392
03:50:23,080 --> 03:50:24,380
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

3393
03:50:31,420 --> 03:50:32,560
I may have fucked myself.

3394
03:50:37,940 --> 03:50:38,660
Did I look at him?

3395
03:50:39,000 --> 03:50:40,120
Okay, I thought I looked at him.

3396
03:50:40,300 --> 03:50:41,060
That would have been the enemy.

3397
03:50:49,600 --> 03:50:50,720
Come on, come on.

3398
03:50:51,240 --> 03:50:52,180
Show me your head.

3399
03:50:52,840 --> 03:50:53,300
Peak.

3400
03:50:59,220 --> 03:51:01,020
Nah, I'm gonna have to light it.

3401
03:51:01,460 --> 03:51:02,340
They keep spawning.

3402
03:51:02,920 --> 03:51:03,820
These fuckers.

3403
03:51:05,860 --> 03:51:07,020
Behind enemy lines.

3404
03:51:09,220 --> 03:51:10,220
Just like that.

3405
03:51:11,220 --> 03:51:11,960
Light that up.

3406
03:51:12,740 --> 03:51:13,460
Ah, juking!

3407
03:51:13,660 --> 03:51:14,260
Master juker.

3408
03:51:14,660 --> 03:51:15,260
It's me.

3409
03:51:18,220 --> 03:51:20,480
They all fell down trying to follow me.

3410
03:51:21,820 --> 03:51:22,360
Idiots.

3411
03:51:22,980 --> 03:51:24,060
Why are there so many?

3412
03:51:27,300 --> 03:51:28,840
Why is the spawn here so intense?

3413
03:51:31,220 --> 03:51:31,760
Boink.

3414
03:51:40,380 --> 03:51:41,000
Come on.

3415
03:51:46,640 --> 03:51:47,460
I hate you.

3416
03:51:49,900 --> 03:51:50,980
I'm gonna have to go down here.

3417
03:51:51,640 --> 03:51:53,500
There's too much spawning happening right here.

3418
03:51:55,140 --> 03:51:56,320
It's just not okay.

3419
03:51:59,620 --> 03:52:02,520
Now, how far away from my home am I right now?

3420
03:52:02,720 --> 03:52:04,260
That's the question I should be asking myself.

3421
03:52:10,340 --> 03:52:12,640
And I would say I'm still sort of close.

3422
03:52:27,430 --> 03:52:28,150
That's a lot.

3423
03:52:29,870 --> 03:52:33,810
Do you remember the days when I was intrigued by the diamond find?

3424
03:52:34,970 --> 03:52:35,730
Not anymore.

3425
03:52:36,430 --> 03:52:37,550
It is commonplace.

3426
03:52:37,790 --> 03:52:43,990
I think the only thing that really makes me pause nowadays is, like, finding... What's it called?

3427
03:52:44,070 --> 03:52:45,150
The next level of that, you know?

3428
03:52:46,770 --> 03:52:48,850
Why did I want to say Seaphorium Charge?

3429
03:52:49,750 --> 03:52:50,230
No.

3430
03:52:51,430 --> 03:52:53,830
It's, um... Netherite.

3431
03:52:54,010 --> 03:52:54,490
Netherite.

3432
03:52:55,890 --> 03:52:58,710
When I find that, it's a pretty big event.

3433
03:52:59,870 --> 03:53:00,630
Diamonds, though?

3434
03:53:00,770 --> 03:53:00,950
Nah.

3435
03:53:01,590 --> 03:53:02,390
Not even close.

3436
03:53:05,530 --> 03:53:16,010
You know how at birthday parties you blow into those annoying things that extend and go... That's about the level of excitement I feel when I find diamonds in this game.

3437
03:53:16,330 --> 03:53:20,290
It's one person blowing that for about two and a half seconds.

3438
03:53:20,610 --> 03:53:22,970
And then, you know, stopping.

3439
03:53:28,070 --> 03:53:29,870
Look how big this fucking place is.

3440
03:53:31,370 --> 03:53:33,930
Can you believe I've almost lit this entire cave?

3441
03:53:37,270 --> 03:53:38,950
Now that's some commitment right there, isn't it?

3442
03:53:54,410 --> 03:53:55,430
Let's jump up here.

3443
03:53:56,570 --> 03:53:57,450
Soon out of food!

3444
03:53:57,630 --> 03:53:58,930
That's gonna spell the end of me down here.

3445
03:54:07,530 --> 03:54:08,830
You can explode all you want.

3446
03:54:13,670 --> 03:54:15,290
I see diamonds as well, but I don't care.

3447
03:54:16,330 --> 03:54:17,930
I don't even want to bend down and pick it up.

3448
03:54:18,530 --> 03:54:19,530
That's how rich I am.

3449
03:54:30,880 --> 03:54:31,280
What?

3450
03:54:31,460 --> 03:54:32,240
Why are they exploding?

3451
03:54:33,240 --> 03:54:34,300
I'm not even close.

3452
03:54:45,000 --> 03:54:45,580
Oh god.

3453
03:54:52,020 --> 03:54:53,060
Almost fell to my death.

3454
03:55:00,470 --> 03:55:05,170
See, now that I'm getting a little higher in the cave, this is the problem spots, I think.

3455
03:55:06,030 --> 03:55:07,150
The higher, the worse.

3456
03:55:08,130 --> 03:55:10,450
I mean, I need to take care of them, I mean, if I'm up here.

3457
03:55:12,830 --> 03:55:18,090
All the way down at the bottom, I'm not entirely sure if that is gonna affect the situation, but definitely up here.

3458
03:55:19,570 --> 03:55:21,150
So I prioritize these more.

3459
03:55:23,030 --> 03:55:23,650
These areas.

3460
03:55:24,970 --> 03:55:25,810
Light that up.

3461
03:55:27,030 --> 03:55:27,430
Spider.

3462
03:55:29,100 --> 03:55:29,420
Die.

3463
03:55:32,660 --> 03:55:33,320
And we eat.

3464
03:55:45,620 --> 03:55:46,520
Let's do that.

3465
03:55:47,460 --> 03:55:51,020
In fact, I'm gonna use this last stack of torches that I have, and then I'm going up again.

3466
03:55:51,520 --> 03:55:53,080
And then it's time for another round of testing.

3467
03:55:56,970 --> 03:55:58,310
We should see an improvement.

3468
03:56:01,210 --> 03:56:06,570
Like... Definitely, like, at least one item after the amount of time I usually wait.

3469
03:56:06,750 --> 03:56:07,510
Instead of nothing.

3470
03:56:08,010 --> 03:56:08,830
That's my prediction.

3471
03:56:09,050 --> 03:56:11,050
I just want a little improvement, and I'm happy.

3472
03:56:16,150 --> 03:56:17,470
No, no, up, up, up.

3473
03:56:20,090 --> 03:56:21,310
Okay, this is pretty well lit.

3474
03:56:21,310 --> 03:56:22,330
I like it, I like it.

3475
03:56:26,540 --> 03:56:27,660
This is way too dark.

3476
03:56:27,800 --> 03:56:28,180
Look at this.

3477
03:56:28,840 --> 03:56:30,420
Hill, or whatever you want to call it.

3478
03:56:30,500 --> 03:56:31,200
Mountain side?

3479
03:56:31,500 --> 03:56:32,060
Cave side?

3480
03:56:33,120 --> 03:56:34,040
Cliff side?

3481
03:56:35,800 --> 03:56:37,000
I don't know what to call this.

3482
03:56:37,800 --> 03:56:39,100
Maybe like cave wall.

3483
03:56:47,000 --> 03:56:47,900
Light that up.

3484
03:56:49,920 --> 03:56:52,200
I feel like we're back where we were before, kinda.

3485
03:56:53,620 --> 03:56:54,640
Ah, you know, I'll take this.

3486
03:56:54,820 --> 03:56:55,680
I'll take that diamond.

3487
03:56:55,800 --> 03:56:59,040
If it's just sitting there and I have no enemies after me, why not?

3488
03:57:00,780 --> 03:57:02,520
I'll bend down and pick it up.

3489
03:57:06,240 --> 03:57:08,460
This place right here, though, is still kinda dark.

3490
03:57:09,880 --> 03:57:11,300
So we know there's more work to do.

3491
03:57:16,300 --> 03:57:17,240
Nine torches left.

3492
03:57:17,400 --> 03:57:18,700
Let's just start the work here.

3493
03:57:21,920 --> 03:57:23,860
I mean, the work is important.

3494
03:57:25,160 --> 03:57:25,960
And mysterious.

3495
03:57:27,640 --> 03:57:32,760
I've been watching Severance yesterday and today.

3496
03:57:34,180 --> 03:57:35,280
Started the second season.

3497
03:57:35,400 --> 03:57:36,140
It's fucking phenomenal.

3498
03:57:37,040 --> 03:57:38,460
The first one was incredible.

3499
03:57:38,720 --> 03:57:41,120
I watched it based on one of you guys' recommendations.

3500
03:57:41,900 --> 03:57:43,360
And boy, am I glad I did.

3501
03:57:44,280 --> 03:57:45,620
Oh, I have a whole other stack.

3502
03:57:45,800 --> 03:57:46,160
Fantastic.

3503
03:57:49,560 --> 03:57:50,040
Oh.

3504
03:57:50,860 --> 03:57:52,060
I'm soon connecting, look!

3505
03:57:52,340 --> 03:57:53,780
The torch is all... Ah!

3506
03:57:54,280 --> 03:57:54,760
Caven!

3507
03:57:55,440 --> 03:57:57,580
Up, up, up, up, up, out.

3508
03:58:00,360 --> 03:58:02,260
I'm a fucking master of parkour!

3509
03:58:02,640 --> 03:58:03,740
Did you see that?

3510
03:58:04,160 --> 03:58:06,140
Tell me that wasn't pro-level shit.

3511
03:58:06,840 --> 03:58:07,900
That was amazing.

3512
03:58:09,440 --> 03:58:11,980
Not to tout my own horn too much, but...

3513
03:58:15,720 --> 03:58:16,120
Oh.

3514
03:58:16,400 --> 03:58:16,780
No, wait.

3515
03:58:16,820 --> 03:58:17,560
Is it toot or tout?

3516
03:58:17,820 --> 03:58:18,100
I don't know.

3517
03:58:18,220 --> 03:58:18,780
Toot my horn?

3518
03:58:18,880 --> 03:58:19,100
Tout?

3519
03:58:21,020 --> 03:58:21,420
Fuck.

3520
03:58:22,380 --> 03:58:22,760
Okay.

3521
03:58:22,940 --> 03:58:24,040
I'm playing with fire here.

3522
03:58:24,140 --> 03:58:26,460
I have one food left, and I'm almost out of energy.

3523
03:58:29,980 --> 03:58:31,320
He ran through the lava!

3524
03:58:32,260 --> 03:58:33,180
Why are you doing that?

3525
03:58:43,720 --> 03:58:45,920
Oh, he stopped moving at the last second.

3526
