4060
04:31:47,060 --> 04:31:48,640
A little shitter of a cave.

4061
04:31:53,770 --> 04:31:55,450
Because it's very close to the surface.

4062
04:31:57,690 --> 04:31:59,790
And now we encounter my torches again.

4063
04:31:59,990 --> 04:32:00,130
Good.

4064
04:32:00,750 --> 04:32:01,250
Back out.

4065
04:32:01,470 --> 04:32:02,050
Let's find that dog.

4066
04:32:04,710 --> 04:32:06,070
Kind of want to get that dog in me.

4067
04:32:07,510 --> 04:32:08,230
Ah, wrong way!

4068
04:32:09,490 --> 04:32:10,170
Where's the exit?

4069
04:32:12,370 --> 04:32:12,770
Here?

4070
04:32:13,710 --> 04:32:14,110
No.

4071
04:32:15,130 --> 04:32:16,270
Oh my god, I don't know.

4072
04:32:16,450 --> 04:32:16,650
Here?

4073
04:32:17,530 --> 04:32:21,930
Yeah, this is... Out we go!

4074
04:32:28,920 --> 04:32:29,660
Where are you at?

4075
04:32:29,760 --> 04:32:31,000
There you are, look at you.

4076
04:32:31,760 --> 04:32:33,240
I brought bones for you.

4077
04:32:37,560 --> 04:32:41,420
If I can't have success with the Orphan Crusher, maybe I can have success with you.

4078
04:32:42,400 --> 04:32:43,100
What do you say?

4079
04:32:44,320 --> 04:32:44,760
No?

4080
04:32:47,580 --> 04:32:50,540
If you love me with this next bone, then she loves me.

4081
04:32:51,940 --> 04:32:52,380
Fuck.

4082
04:32:52,860 --> 04:32:53,680
The next bone.

4083
04:32:54,240 --> 04:32:54,580
No!

4084
04:32:54,820 --> 04:32:55,200
Next bone.

4085
04:32:56,120 --> 04:32:56,640
Love me!

4086
04:32:56,820 --> 04:32:57,360
Okay, there we go.

4087
04:32:59,560 --> 04:33:00,100
Come on.

4088
04:33:00,700 --> 04:33:01,260
Let's go.

4089
04:33:07,820 --> 04:33:08,920
Oh, you're below the tree.

4090
04:33:09,100 --> 04:33:09,420
That's okay.

4091
04:33:10,960 --> 04:33:12,400
Oh, yeah, he's gonna follow me no matter what.

4092
04:33:12,500 --> 04:33:13,680
I'm not on a leash.

4093
04:33:13,940 --> 04:33:15,280
I mean, he's not on a leash.

4094
04:33:16,540 --> 04:33:17,880
Can we find a friend for you?

4095
04:33:18,140 --> 04:33:19,140
So you're not all lonely.

4096
04:33:19,260 --> 04:33:20,260
I mean, there's ODB at home.

4097
04:33:20,740 --> 04:33:21,900
He's quite the guy, you know?

4098
04:33:22,940 --> 04:33:24,800
I'm sure you'll be good friends with him.

4099
04:33:26,400 --> 04:33:27,120
Look at this there.

4100
04:33:27,440 --> 04:33:28,660
I have no idea what this is.

4101
04:33:29,120 --> 04:33:29,720
I don't know.

4102
04:33:29,800 --> 04:33:30,620
I know nothing about that.

4103
04:33:31,440 --> 04:33:32,760
This is a problem.

4104
04:33:34,360 --> 04:33:35,680
When I see it, I fix it.

4105
04:33:37,020 --> 04:33:38,840
It's so close to home, it's a big cave.

4106
04:33:38,980 --> 04:33:39,780
This is bad.

4107
04:33:40,460 --> 04:33:44,380
This right here could be the ultimate problem that I encounter in my life.

4108
04:33:45,380 --> 04:33:46,240
Come on, doggo.

4109
04:33:46,780 --> 04:33:48,080
We have caves to light.

4110
04:33:48,600 --> 04:33:50,500
You thought we were done lighting caves?

4111
04:33:50,920 --> 04:33:51,700
You're wrong.

4112
04:33:52,880 --> 04:33:54,480
We're not even close to being done.

4113
04:33:55,060 --> 04:33:56,780
This world is fraught with caves.

4114
04:33:57,680 --> 04:34:00,100
In fact, some would say it's the whole point of the game.

4115
04:34:01,200 --> 04:34:02,500
I reject that notion.

4116
04:34:03,080 --> 04:34:05,380
I say we fill all the caves up with light.

4117
04:34:06,600 --> 04:34:07,260
Get him!

4118
04:34:08,480 --> 04:34:09,220
Get him!

4119
04:34:10,680 --> 04:34:11,660
Come on, doggo.

4120
04:34:11,920 --> 04:34:12,340
Yes!

4121
04:34:14,560 --> 04:34:15,260
Get him!

4122
04:34:15,520 --> 04:34:16,440
Wait, is he running away?

4123
04:34:18,140 --> 04:34:18,660
Hey!

4124
04:34:19,540 --> 04:34:21,060
Wow, the dog is powerful.

4125
04:34:23,040 --> 04:34:23,560
Hello?

4126
04:34:26,640 --> 04:34:27,680
That was nice!

4127
04:34:28,540 --> 04:34:29,540
Good job, buddy.

4128
04:34:30,760 --> 04:34:32,340
I think your name is gonna be Erica.

4129
04:34:36,780 --> 04:34:39,040
Okay, we have lighted these caves up successfully.

4130
04:34:40,500 --> 04:34:42,400
Feels kind of nice having this dog with me.

4131
04:34:45,330 --> 04:34:46,430
Like my little guardian.

4132
04:34:47,650 --> 04:34:48,830
I see darkness up there.

4133
04:34:48,950 --> 04:34:49,430
Do you see it too?

4134
04:34:50,190 --> 04:34:50,830
See it, Erika?

4135
04:34:52,890 --> 04:34:53,510
Look at that.

4136
04:34:54,070 --> 04:34:55,290
This is what we do to darkness.

4137
04:34:56,230 --> 04:34:57,190
We snuff it out.

4138
04:35:02,470 --> 04:35:03,470
Light that one too.

4139
04:35:04,670 --> 04:35:05,330
Come on now.

4140
04:35:08,370 --> 04:35:09,170
Mind the lava.

4141
04:35:11,730 --> 04:35:13,210
That's a good girl.

4142
04:35:14,550 --> 04:35:15,790
Go up here.

4143
04:35:16,870 --> 04:35:18,910
And darkness encountered again.

4144
04:35:20,390 --> 04:35:22,750
Ooh, bad, bad, bad, bad, bad, bad.

4145
04:35:28,210 --> 04:35:29,030
Come on.

4146
04:35:30,930 --> 04:35:32,110
Are we looping?

4147
04:35:33,570 --> 04:35:34,510
What's this?

4148
04:35:38,480 --> 04:35:39,200
It's diorite.

4149
04:35:40,220 --> 04:35:41,760
It's like a huge collection of it.

4150
04:35:44,060 --> 04:35:44,820
Oh, here we go.

4151
04:35:45,980 --> 04:35:46,340
Fuck!

4152
04:35:58,780 --> 04:36:00,580
Man, this is one complicated set of caves.

4153
04:36:00,700 --> 04:36:01,820
This is the real problem.

4154
04:36:02,280 --> 04:36:04,180
Stuff like this, I had no idea existed, right?

4155
04:36:04,340 --> 04:36:06,380
And then... I don't know.

4156
04:36:09,300 --> 04:36:11,320
Then it's just there, ruining my day.

4157
04:36:21,440 --> 04:36:22,780
I'm hearing mops still.

4158
04:36:25,780 --> 04:36:26,620
Where are you?

4159
04:36:28,400 --> 04:36:29,680
Something is walking here.

4160
04:36:33,570 --> 04:36:34,790
Hey, I'm walking here.

4161
04:36:37,530 --> 04:36:39,490
Oh wait, am I hearing cows and shit?

4162
04:36:39,690 --> 04:36:40,330
Yeah, I think I am.

4163
04:36:44,630 --> 04:36:45,730
You see something up there?

4164
04:36:46,530 --> 04:36:47,170
Huh, girl?

4165
04:36:48,070 --> 04:36:48,950
I hear skeletons.

4166
04:37:03,350 --> 04:37:04,930
What the hell is going on here?

4167
04:37:08,210 --> 04:37:08,770
Oh!

4168
04:37:09,770 --> 04:37:10,430
Get him!

4169
04:37:12,410 --> 04:37:13,270
Holy shit!

4170
04:37:24,070 --> 04:37:25,730
Yo, sick!

4171
04:37:26,490 --> 04:37:27,630
Again, though, skeleton.

4172
04:37:28,010 --> 04:37:29,830
Unfortunate, but not bad.

4173
04:37:30,450 --> 04:37:31,330
I like it.

4174
04:37:33,290 --> 04:37:34,350
Gunpowder, I'll take it.

4175
04:37:38,630 --> 04:37:41,350
Take all this, take... I don't even know what to take.

4176
04:37:46,620 --> 04:37:47,320
Alright.

4177
04:37:47,320 --> 04:37:51,520
Man, I cannot believe how much crap is below my village.

4178
04:37:52,420 --> 04:37:53,460
It's insanity.

4179
04:37:58,020 --> 04:37:58,820
There we go.

4180
04:38:00,760 --> 04:38:02,580
Just like that, hidden away inside a wall.

4181
04:38:04,720 --> 04:38:09,100
Well, this can definitely become some kind of crusher, right?

4182
04:38:09,320 --> 04:38:11,020
I mean, this is the easiest crusher in the world.

4183
04:38:12,800 --> 04:38:17,620
The thing is, though, it's not creepers.

4184
04:38:18,500 --> 04:38:19,420
That's the problem with this.

4185
04:38:19,500 --> 04:38:20,520
Like, I don't care about skeletons.

4186
04:38:20,700 --> 04:38:21,160
Why do I care?

4187
04:38:21,240 --> 04:38:21,880
I don't care about them.

4188
04:38:23,020 --> 04:38:24,060
I need creepers.

4189
04:38:24,240 --> 04:38:28,880
I need blast... I need to be able... I need... You know what I need to be able to make en masse?

4190
04:38:29,360 --> 04:38:33,860
This is actually... I don't even care about the Elytra at this point.

4191
04:38:34,060 --> 04:38:34,580
I don't.

4192
04:38:34,940 --> 04:38:38,720
What I want to be able to make a lot of... Can you guess it?

4193
04:38:39,940 --> 04:38:40,860
It's TNT.

4194
04:38:43,580 --> 04:38:47,320
I need... so much TNT.

4195
04:38:47,500 --> 04:38:49,660
Because it's the funniest block in the game.

4196
04:38:50,080 --> 04:38:51,080
And I love it.

4197
04:38:51,370 --> 04:38:52,770
You can blow shit up with it.

4198
04:38:53,350 --> 04:39:00,110
I can go to the nether with it and start blast-digging my way through and try to find some netherite, you know?

4199
04:39:05,330 --> 04:39:05,690
Okay.

4200
04:39:07,210 --> 04:39:10,810
I kind of want to make its direct path up from that, actually, so I don't forget what this is.

4201
04:39:15,510 --> 04:39:16,850
Oh, careful of the lava.

4202
04:39:17,670 --> 04:39:18,570
What did I say?

4203
04:39:18,670 --> 04:39:18,930
What did I say?

4204
04:39:19,410 --> 04:39:20,110
I'm dead.

4205
04:39:20,250 --> 04:39:20,430
I'm dead.

4206
04:39:20,570 --> 04:39:20,670
I'm dead.

4207
04:39:21,490 --> 04:39:22,290
Potion of healing!

4208
04:39:24,050 --> 04:39:24,630
Ah!

4209
04:39:26,110 --> 04:39:26,690
Water!

4210
04:39:29,630 --> 04:39:30,210
Water!

4211
04:39:32,390 --> 04:39:32,970
Ah!

4212
04:39:34,430 --> 04:39:35,590
Actually saved me.

4213
04:39:36,850 --> 04:39:37,430
Insane.

4214
04:39:38,730 --> 04:39:39,670
Holy crap.

4215
04:39:41,250 --> 04:39:42,210
Let's get out of here.

4216
04:39:46,970 --> 04:39:48,010
Good luck, doggo.

4217
04:39:48,230 --> 04:39:49,790
See if you can follow me like this.

4218
04:40:13,550 --> 04:40:15,290
Like a launch tube on a submarine.

4219
04:40:15,610 --> 04:40:17,130
The way I just emerged from there.

4220
04:40:18,770 --> 04:40:19,650
Isn't that beautiful?

4221
04:40:21,050 --> 04:40:22,490
Here we go with the beautiful landing.

4222
04:40:23,690 --> 04:40:24,250
Beep beep.

4223
04:40:26,090 --> 04:40:26,630
Lovely.

4224
04:40:27,750 --> 04:40:29,230
Hey, there you are.

4225
04:40:29,510 --> 04:40:31,430
Let's go grab a name tag for you.

4226
04:40:34,930 --> 04:40:35,470
Erica.

4227
04:40:36,410 --> 04:40:37,210
Where you at?

4228
04:40:40,300 --> 04:40:41,040
You upstairs?

4229
04:40:43,000 --> 04:40:43,820
There you are.

4230
04:40:44,040 --> 04:40:44,300
Boom!

4231
04:40:45,640 --> 04:40:46,880
Go say hi to Odie Bee!

4232
04:40:48,040 --> 04:40:48,920
See where he's hiding.

4233
04:40:51,340 --> 04:40:52,360
Yo, Odie Bee!

4234
04:40:56,700 --> 04:40:58,000
Where have you gone?

4235
04:41:06,790 --> 04:41:07,190
Hello?

4236
04:41:07,190 --> 04:41:08,670
He's not in his favorite spot.

4237
04:41:10,310 --> 04:41:12,190
Uh-oh, these holes actually make me worried.

4238
04:41:13,190 --> 04:41:15,090
What if he falls into one of these?

4239
04:41:20,010 --> 04:41:23,830
What the... Oh, of course you could just climb over that, you're a spider!

4240
04:41:25,670 --> 04:41:27,150
My village is not safe.

4241
04:41:29,610 --> 04:41:31,510
Uh-oh, I didn't even think about that.

4242
04:41:36,810 --> 04:41:38,190
Wait, where's all my villagers?

4243
04:41:40,430 --> 04:41:41,030
Hello?

4244
04:41:47,910 --> 04:41:48,770
Where's everybody?

4245
04:41:52,210 --> 04:41:54,410
Dude, there's a serial killer about!

4246
04:41:55,010 --> 04:41:55,910
Everyone is gone!

4247
04:41:59,870 --> 04:42:01,770
What is happening here in this village?

4248
04:42:05,520 --> 04:42:07,040
Literally everyone is gone!

4249
04:42:12,040 --> 04:42:12,560
Jaxter!

4250
04:42:13,340 --> 04:42:14,760
The Ripper, is it you?

4251
04:42:16,520 --> 04:42:17,540
Jaxter the Ripster!

4252
04:42:20,800 --> 04:42:21,980
Are you doing it?

4253
04:42:23,720 --> 04:42:25,660
Why are you not waking up when I tell you to?

4254
04:42:26,720 --> 04:42:27,240
Hey!

4255
04:42:28,240 --> 04:42:29,340
I said come out!

4256
04:42:33,240 --> 04:42:34,320
Okay, maybe I go to bed.

4257
04:42:36,120 --> 04:42:37,340
See what happens the next day.

4258
04:42:41,080 --> 04:42:42,620
Oh, that's disturbing.

4259
04:42:43,460 --> 04:42:44,500
Thanks for that, Rick.

4260
04:42:45,780 --> 04:42:46,480
Come on!

4261
04:42:48,720 --> 04:42:49,540
One guy.

4262
04:42:49,780 --> 04:42:50,380
We got Rick.

4263
04:42:51,940 --> 04:42:53,820
Man, what is happening to people?

4264
04:42:54,820 --> 04:42:56,180
Why are they so lazy?

4265
04:42:56,440 --> 04:42:56,900
Come out!

4266
04:42:57,420 --> 04:42:57,780
Donovan!

4267
04:42:58,800 --> 04:42:59,800
Are you deaf?

4268
04:43:02,440 --> 04:43:03,840
Jackster, Rick, Donovan.

4269
04:43:04,400 --> 04:43:05,360
Who's down here?

4270
04:43:12,260 --> 04:43:13,460
Why are people dying?

4271
04:43:14,840 --> 04:43:16,760
There's some kind of problem with the wall over here.

4272
04:43:17,960 --> 04:43:20,700
Like, the fact that we saw a zombie in here earlier...

4273
04:43:27,720 --> 04:43:28,740
Get rid of that, maybe.

4274
04:43:31,720 --> 04:43:32,600
Oh, fuck.

4275
04:43:35,500 --> 04:43:37,040
Like, I don't know, man.

4276
04:43:37,160 --> 04:43:38,000
I don't know, I don't know.

4277
04:43:39,160 --> 04:43:42,760
And where's Billy... Billy Bob is gone, I guess, but where's the other ones?

4278
04:43:43,840 --> 04:43:44,620
Everyone is gone!

4279
04:43:45,260 --> 04:43:46,220
Oh, there's one here.

4280
04:43:49,100 --> 04:43:51,140
Well, that's something for future me to think about.

4281
04:43:51,660 --> 04:43:52,660
That's a fucking tragedy.

4282
04:43:52,840 --> 04:43:53,520
I don't know what's happening.

4283
04:43:53,620 --> 04:43:55,200
We have some kind of serial killer about.

4284
04:43:55,640 --> 04:43:57,040
And people are slowly dying.

4285
04:43:57,200 --> 04:43:57,940
ODB is missing.

4286
04:44:00,480 --> 04:44:01,140
It's hell.

4287
04:44:02,100 --> 04:44:02,960
Maybe it's karma.

4288
04:44:03,200 --> 04:44:05,520
The fact that I'm trying to create an orphan crusher.

4289
04:44:06,000 --> 04:44:07,960
It's simply against the rules of the universe.

4290
04:44:08,940 --> 04:44:10,660
I'm being punished for my sins.

4291
04:44:11,700 --> 04:44:12,600
And you know what?

4292
04:44:13,480 --> 04:44:14,200
Deservedly so.

4293
04:44:14,440 --> 04:44:15,340
What was I thinking?

4294
04:44:25,290 --> 04:44:25,650
Unbelievable.

4295
04:44:28,990 --> 04:44:30,170
Alright, let me pull you up.

4296
04:44:32,710 --> 04:44:33,370
There we go.

4297
04:44:34,290 --> 04:44:34,990
What's up, people?

4298
04:44:40,010 --> 04:44:42,970
I think we have sufficiently gone to war today.

4299
04:44:43,610 --> 04:44:44,910
Killed a lot of the darkness.

4300
04:44:45,750 --> 04:44:48,330
Unfortunately, it has not helped the situation very much.

4301
04:44:50,190 --> 04:44:51,890
I did kill a bunch of enemies.

4302
04:44:54,070 --> 04:44:54,790
But yeah.

4303
04:44:56,950 --> 04:44:58,750
The foxes didn't deserve to die.

4304
04:44:59,990 --> 04:45:03,470
Not only did they deserve it, I felt joy killing them.

4305
04:45:04,770 --> 04:45:05,490
That's right.

4306
04:45:07,180 --> 04:45:09,720
I actually... it set my heart aflutter.

4307
04:45:15,120 --> 04:45:16,200
I don't know, man.

4308
04:45:16,580 --> 04:45:19,840
I killed them because they were taking up spawns.

4309
04:45:22,260 --> 04:45:23,180
And you know what?

4310
04:45:23,280 --> 04:45:29,660
It is possible that I, in my sleep, have gone around and killed villagers because they took up spawns.

4311
04:45:31,060 --> 04:45:33,340
I've become obsessed with this notion that...

4312
04:45:34,040 --> 04:45:35,480
Something isn't right with the world.

4313
04:45:36,840 --> 04:45:42,120
You know, when I go to the supermarket in real life, I'm thinking, why is there so little people here?

4314
04:45:42,820 --> 04:45:44,660
Are they all spawning down at the library?

4315
04:45:45,560 --> 04:45:47,320
I gotta go there and light it up, you know?

4316
04:45:48,740 --> 04:45:50,200
And that's how that place burned down.

4317
04:45:54,260 --> 04:45:56,520
That animal Oliver can't even say his name.

4318
04:45:57,400 --> 04:45:58,200
Which animal?

4319
04:45:58,320 --> 04:45:58,540
ODB?

4320
04:46:01,460 --> 04:46:02,560
What's this music called?

4321
04:46:03,920 --> 04:46:05,960
I forgot the name.

4322
04:46:06,460 --> 04:46:10,440
I think it's called... It's one of the tracks from Desert Combat.

4323
04:46:10,820 --> 04:46:12,860
The mod for Battlefield 1942.

4324
04:46:13,820 --> 04:46:15,280
It's an old one.

4325
04:46:15,400 --> 04:46:18,620
I don't expect any one of you to actually have played that game.

4326
04:46:18,780 --> 04:46:22,200
But it was a mod for Battlefield 1942.

4327
04:46:22,890 --> 04:46:26,470
And I think this was the loading screen music for that mod.

4328
04:46:28,090 --> 04:46:29,150
Subs goal was reached.

4329
04:46:29,430 --> 04:46:30,070
Fucking hell.

4330
04:46:30,350 --> 04:46:30,910
You're right.

4331
