4492
04:53:41,560 --> 04:53:42,580
Dementia test stream.

4493
04:53:43,480 --> 04:53:47,560
Wouldn't it be crazy if this is the same stream... like... I don't even know, man.

4494
04:53:47,980 --> 04:53:49,660
What if I actually did say that last time?

4495
04:53:50,680 --> 04:53:51,740
No, I would have remembered.

4496
04:53:53,160 --> 04:53:54,820
You gaslight yourself all the time?

4497
04:53:55,040 --> 04:53:56,060
Yeah, but I do it on purpose.

4498
04:53:57,380 --> 04:53:58,820
I gaslight myself on purpose.

4499
04:54:03,690 --> 04:54:04,410
Oh yeah, yeah, yeah.

4500
04:54:07,310 --> 04:54:11,970
Did you hear the remixed Minecraft music by Andrew Prahlo, composer for Outer Wilds?

4501
04:54:11,990 --> 04:54:12,490
Wait, what?

4502
04:54:13,610 --> 04:54:14,870
