4504
04:54:17,090 --> 04:54:18,070
I mean, I haven't.

4505
04:54:18,210 --> 04:54:20,250
I would like to, but why did he do that?

4506
04:54:21,150 --> 04:54:23,150
What a weird coincidence that he did that.

4507
04:54:24,610 --> 04:54:25,930
