4511
04:54:32,690 --> 04:54:34,610
This is good, but let me cook.

4512
04:54:36,230 --> 04:54:37,690
You're an amazing actor then?

4513
04:54:40,770 --> 04:54:47,790
The thing is, if you gaslight yourself into believing... Nah, I don't know where I'm going with this.

4514
04:54:47,890 --> 04:54:48,710
I'm not gonna win.

4515
04:54:49,530 --> 04:54:51,170
I dug myself a grave here.

4516
04:54:51,910 --> 04:54:53,710
I'm not gaslighting myself on purpose.

4517
04:54:53,830 --> 04:54:54,270
That was a joke.

4518
04:54:56,190 --> 04:54:57,770
Is it download more brain ram?

4519
04:54:58,350 --> 04:54:59,570
I wish it was that easy.

4520
04:55:02,550 --> 04:55:06,410
I think it's something you said about when speaking out loud when playing versus solo.

4521
04:55:07,530 --> 04:55:07,970
Yeah.

4522
04:55:09,250 --> 04:55:10,730
There's definitely some truth to that.

4523
04:55:10,970 --> 04:55:13,430
I think I would be way more... You know what would be interesting?

4524
04:55:14,910 --> 04:55:19,110
To have, like, a recording of me playing a game without me saying anything.

4525
04:55:20,570 --> 04:55:22,290
