4526
04:55:22,370 --> 04:55:23,450
If I'm just in the zone.

4527
04:55:24,510 --> 04:55:30,150
Because I know I'm playing way more razor-sharp and focused when I'm not talking out loud.

4528
04:55:31,800 --> 04:55:33,120
It's toot, not toot.

4529
04:55:33,280 --> 04:55:33,500
Okay.

4530
04:55:34,500 --> 04:55:34,980
Or tout.

4531
04:55:35,400 --> 04:55:35,980
Thank you.

4532
04:55:37,760 --> 04:55:38,620
Toot my own horn.

4533
04:55:38,740 --> 04:55:39,620
Yeah, that's what I asked about.

4534
04:55:39,840 --> 04:55:40,620
See, I remembered that.

4535
04:55:40,660 --> 04:55:41,660
That means I don't have dementia.

4536
04:55:42,320 --> 04:55:43,700
The fact that I remembered that...

4537
04:55:47,020 --> 04:55:48,320
You should do a quiet stream.

4538
