And the thing is, with StarCraft, I literally cannot speak while I play, if I'm focused.

4540
04:55:56,940 --> 04:56:00,740
It takes up so much brainpower that I actually can't speak.

4541
04:56:00,900 --> 04:56:03,100
Like, I'm trying to, but I just fail.

4542
04:56:09,580 --> 04:56:10,380
Muted mic stream.

4543
04:56:11,240 --> 04:56:15,720
Yeah, and just at the very end, I go, ah, shit, I'm sorry, I didn't realize I was muted, and then just go offline.

4544
04:56:16,760 --> 04:56:17,980
For, like, five-hour stream.

4545
04:56:22,600 --> 04:56:25,220
That would be something else, wouldn't it?

4546
04:56:26,840 --> 04:56:31,140
But that would be even worse, because then you guys are going to think I'm just as dementia-filled.

4547
04:56:31,280 --> 04:56:35,860
No, you're not going to know, because it may look like I know what I'm doing when I'm not saying anything.

4548
04:56:35,960 --> 04:56:36,800
Have you thought about that?

4549
04:56:37,150 --> 04:56:41,030
Try watching a Minecraft VOD of me without my voiceover.

4550
04:56:41,890 --> 04:56:44,730
It's gonna look like I know exactly what I'm doing at all times.

4551
04:56:46,730 --> 04:56:52,010
Because I'm not gonna be saying, you know what, let's go up on that mountain, and then I seem to be floating away in the water instead.

4552
04:56:52,370 --> 04:56:54,170
It's gonna look like I intended to do that.

4553
04:56:54,490 --> 04:56:56,250
Because you never heard me say that, right?

4554
04:56:57,210 --> 04:56:57,990
Think about it.

4555
04:57:02,370 --> 04:57:03,570
Minus the blind moments.

4556
04:57:04,570 --> 04:57:06,770
No, but most of the time you wouldn't know what I'm looking for.

4557
04:57:06,890 --> 04:57:09,650
I just open my inventory and you can only guess at what I'm looking for.

4558
04:57:10,430 --> 04:57:10,790
Right?

4559
04:57:12,370 --> 04:57:13,710
You should stream Minesweeper.

4560
04:57:13,770 --> 04:57:15,010
I don't even know how that game works.

4561
04:57:15,350 --> 04:57:16,210
No joke.

4562
04:57:17,270 --> 04:57:20,390
I know it's an old game on Windows and stuff, but I always just click randomly.

4563
04:57:20,410 --> 04:57:21,130
I don't know what it does.

4564
04:57:22,290 --> 04:57:22,870
Me neither.

4565
04:57:23,170 --> 04:57:25,390
See, there's so many of us.

4566
04:57:30,510 --> 04:57:34,930
There'd be a lot of silently walking in circles while you're thinking out loud.

4567
04:57:35,250 --> 04:57:38,930
Oh my god, that's gonna look like I actually suffer from something.

4568
04:57:40,310 --> 04:57:41,250
Like, for real.

4569
04:57:41,530 --> 04:57:42,250
